{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wgc-e-7-e10","title":"司马昭敕钟会并进军成都","order":5797,"accounts":[{"id":"wgc-a-7-e10","label":"正文","text":"司马昭敕钟会并进军成都","evidence":["wgc-q0486","wgc-q0079"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0045","role":"惧艾或不从命、敕会并进军成都","evidence":["wgc-q0486","wgc-q0079"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0073","role":"受敕进军","evidence":["wgc-q0486","wgc-q0079"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原纪年逐项对读；不从邻段继承绝对年份。","evidence":["wgc-q0486","wgc-q0079"]},"ordering_evidence":"wgc-q0486"}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0045","name":"司马昭","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0073","name":"钟会","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wgc-q0079","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-513967ffa2e8c3abfabc","layer":"original","quote":"会内有异志〖1〗，因邓艾承制专事，密白“艾有反状”；﹝一﹞于是诏书槛车征艾。司马文王惧艾或不从命，敕会并进军成都。监军卫瓘在会前行，以文王手笔令宣喻艾军；艾军皆释仗，遂收艾入槛车。会所惮惟艾，艾既擒而会寻至，独统大众，威震西土。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":558,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":114,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0486","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-513967ffa2e8c3abfabc","layer":"original","quote":"司马文王惧艾或不从命，敕会并进军成都","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":558,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":38,"end":56,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
